WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.085
Hari:
You can't save yourselves.

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:04.004
Hari:
But you can save your legacy.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:07.132
♪♪

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.762
♪♪

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:20.312
(Walking) (Water drips)

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:23.690
Demerzel:
You can't be here.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.483
You know that.

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:28.695
I can't be the first one who
wanted to see my youngest self.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:32.532
(Plinked)
♪♪

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.992
Strange.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.619
Watching yourself being born.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:41.250
♪♪

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.294
Brother Day:
Our genetic dynasty has reigned
for almost four-

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.379
centuries.

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:47.923
♪♪

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.633
Brother Day:
The might of the Imperium

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.552
(Explosions)

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.722
Brother Day:
has brought peace to thousands
of worlds.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.600
♪♪

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.478
Brother Day:
But the beliefs of one man.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:02.104
♪♪

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:05.482
Brother Day:
Now threaten the empire's very
existence.

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:09.027
♪♪

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.904
I'm not a revolutionary.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.072
♪♪

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.241
Gaal:
His calculations are correct.

00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:16.952
The Empire is dying.

00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:18.787
Hari:
Order will vanish.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:21.540
Wars will be endless.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.583
Only we can shorten the
darkness.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:28.839
♪♪

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:31.425
Brother Day:
The man has amassed a following.

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:34.261
Brother Day:
People who hinge their hopes on
every

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:35.721
word Seldon utters.

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:36.972
♪♪

00:01:36.972 --> 00:01:40.058
Brother Day:
Words have a way of fanning
into wildfires.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.226
♪♪

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:43.061
Hari:
You can't save yourselves.

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:46.648
♪♪

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:48.483
Hari:
But you can your legacy.

00:01:48.483 --> 00:02:07.586
♪♪

